    "description": "The CAMEX-3 DC-8 JPL Laser Hygrometer (LASERH) Ferry and Dry Run (FDR) dataset files contain information recorded by the JPL Laser Hygrometer (LASERH) instrument onboard the NASA DC-8 research aircraft. These data files contain the water vapor content collected during ferry and dry run in support of the third field campaign in the Convection And Moisture EXperiment (CAMEX) series, CAMEX-3. This field campaign took place from August to September 1998 based out of Patrick Air Force Base in Florida, with the purpose of studying various aspects of tropical cyclones in the region. The ferry and dry run took place from August 6, 1998 through August 13, 1998. These data are available in ASCII file format.",
